<p>You can throw knives with lightning speed, increasing your attack speed with them by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 19%, 24%, 27%, 31%</acronym> and giving you a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 13%, 16%, 19%, 21%</acronym> chance when striking a target in melee to throw a knife at a random foe within 7 tiles for 100% damage. </p><p>This bonus attack can only trigger once per turn, and does not trigger from throwing knife attacks.</p>